    "profile_text": {
        "body": "SoundHound AI, Inc. is a public company traded under the ticker SOUN and headquartered in Claymont, Delaware. Its CIK is 0001840856. According to its website, the company's OASYS platform powers voice-native AI agents that handle service, operations, and commerce conversations for enterprise brands. The site describes the technology as agentic AI and as a voice AI platform with hybrid cloud and embedded connectivity, aimed at always-on voice experiences.\n\nThe site presents customer commentary rather than product detail. One unnamed customer says SoundHound's agentic AI lets it resolve more requests faster and scale operations as demand grows. Another says the voice AI technology has helped franchisees process orders more efficiently, particularly during peak hours, and produce a consistent ordering experience. A third cites the hybrid cloud and embedded connectivity as enabling always-on voice experiences for customers on the go. No specific products are tracked in the company's record here.\n\nThe company's legal exposure is recorded in Delaware, with 33 matters noted. No lawsuits, no MCP servers, and no products are listed for it.",
